<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" xml:lang="bn-Beng-IN" id="m81295-fs-id2583328.bn-Beng-IN"><title>m81295-fs-id2583328</title><content><note id="fs-id2583328" class="be-prepared">
<exercise id="fs-idm345566752">
<problem id="fs-idm345570240">
<para id="fs-idm347995504">গুণ করো: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math><newline />
না পারলে <link target-id="fs-id1863495" document="m81286">ভগ্নাংশের গুণ</link> অংশটি আবার দেখো।</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idm345728848">
<para id="fs-idm344657136"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>27</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>100</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise></note>
